                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">近日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，绍兴一中2022届生物竞赛小组</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在学科竞赛支部书记范捷老师的带领下，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">走进了黄酒集团下的古越龙山酿酒一厂和国家黄酒工程技术研究中心，开展生物科技研学与职业体验活动。在专家讲解和亲身动手实践</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等多样体验下</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，一中学子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不但了解到</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">黄酒</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酿</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">造</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工艺制作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">流</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">程，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也从</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酿造师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">言传身教中体悟到可贵的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工匠精神，更</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">鲜活地</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感受到现代生物科技与传统工艺融合的魅力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/8/202208240914596012.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202208240914596012.png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.走进古越龙山，传承酿酒工艺</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在古越龙山酿酒一厂的专业技术人员的讲解下，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生们</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了解到传统的酿造工艺</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的八个步骤</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：“浸米—蒸饭—落缸—开耙—压榨—煎酒—封坛—储存</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月正是“黄酒之魂”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">——</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酒药的制作时间，在厂里</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酿造</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">师傅们的指导下，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">亲自动手体验了酒药的制作</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师傅告诉</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生们说：“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们这酒药是一代代传下来的，前一代选取优良成品储存，来年再加入下一代中，如今已传承三百多代</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">！”学生们纷纷</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感叹：这也许就是绍兴黄酒源远流长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、闻名遐迩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的原因吧！</span></p><p style="font-family: undefined;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: black;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914164597.Jpeg" style="width: 3.041667in; height: 2.28125in" alt="202208240914167041.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: undefined;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: black;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914161525.Jpeg" style="width: 3.124305in; height: 2.382639in" alt="202208240914162307.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914161101.Jpeg" style="width: 3.690972in; height: 2.820833in" alt="202208240914164412.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914165937.Jpeg" style="width: 3.689583in; height: 2.829861in" alt="202208240914168552.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>探寻现代科技，体验智能酿酒</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在黄酒集团的精心安排下，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生们</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不但参观了传统手工酿酒的工艺，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来到了国家黄酒工程技术研究中心，感知现代化智能酿酒的变革，例如：坛酒机器人系统、绍兴黄酒的云数据、黄酒产品的追溯体系、黄酒机械化发酵槽和储酒设备与技术等</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等。在参观中，学生们深刻地认识到科技</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">创新的力量</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对于企业发展的重要性</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914163820.Jpeg" style="width: 3.520139in; height: 2.640278in" alt="202208240914167337.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914161916.Jpeg" style="width: 3.522222in; height: 2.642361in" alt="202208240914160374.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>反思</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>课堂</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>实验</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>领悟</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>工匠精神</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学们带着问题在参观中不断反思、验证，促进了竞赛课程学习的理解与深化。一位同学有感而发地说：“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之前我们在竞赛课程中也曾尝试过酿酒，却以霉变告终</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过此次研学，我们对之前实验失败的原因进行了反思。在酿酒过程中，糯米内的淀粉首先在根霉菌的作用下糖化，之后再在酵母菌的作用下酒化，酒化过程中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酵母菌与杂菌存在竞争关系，如果杂菌过</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">多，就会导致酸化。并且发酵过程中糖化程度过高，则会抑制酒化过程，两者需要保持微妙的平衡，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">酒化、糖化、酸化，在酿造中是同时进行的，这是菌种间的优势较量，也是对老师傅的考验，有经验的老师傅通过手的感知、鼻的闻味、口的品尝就可以直接判断发酵的程度，甚至可以尝出酒的各种指标数据</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这种精益求精</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">追求卓越的工匠精神非常值得我们学习。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914168466.Jpeg" style="width: 3.759028in; height: 2.882639in" alt="202208240914165471.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914160723.Jpeg" style="width: 3.830555in; height: 2.873611in" alt="202208240914169238.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\8\202208240914161526.Jpeg" style="width: 3.843055in; height: 2.945139in" alt="202208240914169307.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>感悟初心使命，立志科技报国 </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为实现“共同富裕先行、省域现代化先行”，浙江省第十五</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党代会明确提出</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要打造世界重要人才中心和创新高地战略支点。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞赛</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学子</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在研学行动中</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">既</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感受到身为一中人所受到的赞誉，更感受到肩负科技创新的</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">使命</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们有义务努力学习，将书本上的知识与实践结合起来，将学到的知识学以致用。未来，国家的进一步发展需要我们青年一代奋发图强</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、贡献智慧</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">力量！</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #050505;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”一位学子如是说。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                       </span></p>
    
